ve Games","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/curvedigital"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Curve Games","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/curvedigital"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/3fe03e7263f56650b7c63181521ab2b9.webp?t=1749737711[/img][/p][p]《Serial Cleaner》是一款以70年代美国为背景的快节奏潜行动作游戏。你将扮演职业黑帮清道夫，负责处理尸体、清理血迹、藏匿证据——同时躲避警察的追捕。保持隐蔽、快速行动，确保犯罪现场不留痕迹。记住：优秀的清道夫永远不会被抓到！[/p][p][/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/9a75be23a4bb28e4f315a5eeaa60df75.webp?t=1749737711[/img][/p][p]无论是塞进旅行车后备箱，还是从摩天大楼抛下——务必让这些尸体彻底消失！[/p][p][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/e4365fec63bf0d3fc6652e6eda7ff366.poster.avif?t=1749737711\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/e4365fec63bf0d3fc6652e6eda7ff366.webm?t=1749737711\" width=\"616\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid][/p][p][/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/0437050963c8e03f6de999ba1052503c.webp?t=1749737711[/img][/p][p]谁能想到一具尸体会有这么多血？……用吸尘器尽可能清理干净，确保警察不会起疑！[/p][p][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/ed1f43d153d43785bd9431ed1b99359a.poster.avif?t=1749737711\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/ed1f43d153d43785bd9431ed1b99359a.webm?t=1749737711\" width=\"616\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid][/p][p][/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/bead0881102b9784ee4a2def6500619c.webp?t=1749737711[/img][/p][p]凶器没带走？罪证文件散落一地？无论是什么，务必抢在警察之前处理掉！[/p][p][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/9f7eb67ec3ba0306f750e7fed87304ee.poster.avif?t=1749737711\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/9f7eb67ec3ba0306f750e7fed87304ee.webm?t=1749737711\" width=\"616\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid][/p][p][/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/be2a43927ee03c61244854dc95046b06.webp?t=1749737711[/img][/p][p]顶尖清道夫从不会被发现！利用一切手段隐藏行踪，躲避追捕！[/p][p][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/b0168dc336273fb80153e36e0c57ebca.poster.avif?t=1749737711\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/b0168dc336273fb80153e36e0c57ebca.webm?t=1749737711\" width=\"616\" height=\"300\"][/imgvid][/p][p][/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522210/extras/8478ae63b17831a7c210605b46eb80c5.webp?t=1749737711[/img][/p][p]– 沉浸在70年代复古剧情模式中，完成二十个任务合同[/p][p]– 解锁11套主题服装[/p][p]– 伴随放克风格的70年代复古音乐，清理现场，尽情摇摆吧[/p][p]– 每个任务合同包含多个挑战，并设有社区排行榜[/p]","strSnippet":"穿上喇叭裤，戴好墨镜，跳进旅行车，是时候开始你的职业黑帮清道夫工作了！在这款屡获殊荣的复古风2D潜行动作游戏中，你需要潜入现场、清理痕迹、全身而退——伴随着充满放克风格的70年代复古音乐，开始行动吧！"}}]]